<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueGetInteger</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to retrieve an integer value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">long long int SilikoValueGetInteger(
    const SilikoValue *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueGetInteger</function> function gets the
integer value of <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoValueGetInteger</function> returns the integer
  value of <varname>object</varname> if <varname>object</varname>
  holds an integer value. If <varname>object</varname> does not
  hold an integer value, then
  <function>SilikoValueGetInteger</function> returns 0.</para>
</refsection>
